		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="UI_GUIDE_BODY_UPLOAD">
			<Property name="Id" value="UI_GUIDE_BODY_UPLOAD" />
			<Property name="English" value="Every creature, plant, rock, planet or system you discover can be &lt;TRADEABLE&gt;renamed&lt;&gt; and &lt;STELLAR&gt;uploaded&lt;&gt;. You may also rename your &lt;VAL_ON&gt;base, Multi-Tool, and starship&lt;&gt;.&#xA;&#xA;Uploading shares your discovery with other Travellers. Any Traveller who finds that object will see you as the original finder. Uploading rewards &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Nanites&lt;&gt;.&#xA;&#xA;Discover creatures, plants and rocks with the &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Analysis Visor&lt;&gt;. Enter visor mode with &lt;IMG&gt;AIM&lt;&gt;. Analyse your targets with &lt;IMG&gt;BINOCSCAN&lt;&gt;.&#xA;&#xA;Systems and planets are discovered automatically when visited.&#xA;&#xA;Track, rename and upload your discoveries from the &lt;VAL_ON&gt;Discoveries Page&lt;&gt; of the Options Menu." />
