			<Property name="Id" value="UI_GUIDE_BODY_EXPLORATION_6_VRM" />
			<Property name="English" value="Unlock Exocraft by purchasing plans for &lt;STELLAR&gt;Geobays&lt;&gt; at the &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Construction Research Unit&lt;&gt; on the Space Anomaly.&#xA;&#xA;To summon an Exocraft, build an &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Exocraft Geobay&lt;&gt;. Geobays can be built anywhere and are not restricted to your home planet.&#xA;&#xA;When driving an Exocraft, press &lt;IMG&gt;EXOBOOST&lt;&gt; for a short &lt;VAL_ON&gt;speed boost&lt;&gt;. Use &lt;IMG&gt;EXOJUMP&lt;&gt; to &lt;VAL_ON&gt;jump&lt;&gt;.&#xA;Fire your weapon or Mining Beam using &lt;IMG&gt;VEHICLESHOOT&lt;&gt;. Cycle weapon/mining attachments using &lt;IMG&gt;CYCLEVEHWEAPON&lt;&gt;. &#xA;&#xA;While piloting the Minotaur, use &lt;IMG&gt;JUMP&lt;&gt; to activate the thruster. Fire weapons using &lt;IMG&gt;RUN&lt;&gt;, and cycle attachments using &lt;IMG&gt;CYCLEWEAPON&lt;&gt;. &#xA;&#xA;Use &lt;IMG&gt;VEHICLESCAN&lt;&gt; to ping for nearby points of interest. This is more powerful than the Multi-Tool scanner and will reveal additional locations. &#xA;&#xA;Use &lt;IMG&gt;QUICK_MENU&lt;&gt; to access a portable &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Signal Booster&lt;&gt; and scan for specific nearby buildings.&#xA;&#xA;As with your Exosuit and Starship, Exocraft can be &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;upgraded&lt;&gt; for improved performance.&#xA;Install technology upgrades in their &lt;VAL_ON&gt;Inventories&lt;&gt; (&lt;IMG&gt;INVENTORY&lt;&gt;)." />
