		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="UI_GUIDE_BODY_TRADE_2">
			<Property name="Id" value="UI_GUIDE_BODY_TRADE_2" />
			<Property name="English" value="&lt;TRADEABLE&gt;Farming&lt;&gt; can be highly lucrative. Find a good balance of crops and use them to craft new items. &lt;VAL_ON&gt;Combining crafted items&lt;&gt; into more advanced devices will yield &lt;VAL_ON&gt;even greater profits&lt;&gt;.&#xA;&#xA;Build an &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Agricultural Terminal&lt;&gt; and hire a &lt;TRADEABLE&gt;Farmer&lt;&gt; to research new plant types.&#xA;&#xA;Plants can be grown &lt;VAL_ON&gt;outside&lt;&gt; if the weather matches their &lt;TRADEABLE&gt;natural habitat&lt;&gt;. Otherwise, construct a &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Hydroponics Tray&lt;&gt; to nurture the plant.&#xA;&#xA;Large-scale farms may benefit from the decreased maintenance requirements of &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Large Hydroponics Trays&lt;&gt;.&#xA;&#xA;Plants can be harvested once fully grown. Some plants require &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Haz-Mat Gauntlets&lt;&gt;, which can be acquired from an Armourer employed at a &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Weapons Terminal&lt;&gt;.&#xA;&#xA;Each plant species has their own &lt;VAL_ON&gt;yields&lt;&gt; and &lt;VAL_ON&gt;growth times&lt;&gt;. Find a balance of crops to maximise overall profits." />
