		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="UI_GUIDE_BODY_TRADE_3">
			<Property name="Id" value="UI_GUIDE_BODY_TRADE_3" />
			<Property name="English" value="Resources command &lt;VAL_ON&gt;different prices&lt;&gt; in &lt;VAL_ON&gt;different systems&lt;&gt;. Install an &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Economy Scanner&lt;&gt; in your starship to gain access to economic data on the &lt;VAL_ON&gt;Galaxy Map&lt;&gt;.&#xA;&#xA;Plan trade routes to maximise profit. Find &lt;VAL_ON&gt;complementary economy types&lt;&gt; for the perfect trade route. Most goods are influenced by the economy of a system (for example, minerals are cheaper in &lt;VAL_ON&gt;Mining&lt;&gt; economies and more expensive in &lt;VAL_ON&gt;Industrial&lt;&gt; economies).&#xA;&#xA;The &lt;COMMODITY&gt;greatest profit&lt;&gt; for a trader lies in transporting specific &lt;COMMODITY&gt;Trade Goods&lt;&gt;. Study the details of &lt;COMMODITY&gt;Trade Goods&lt;&gt; to learn where to sell them for the most profit. These receive the largest economy-based discounts and bonuses.&#xA;&#xA;The &lt;VAL_ON&gt;wealth&lt;&gt; of a system influences how many goods they have available to sell. High wealth systems are also more likely to have high quality starships." />
