		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="UI_GUIDE_BODY_TRADE_7">
			<Property name="Id" value="UI_GUIDE_BODY_TRADE_7" />
			<Property name="English" value="&lt;SPECIAL&gt;Standing&lt;&gt; is a measure of your &lt;VAL_ON&gt;reputation&lt;&gt; with alien races and factions. &#xA;Track your standing on the &lt;VAL_ON&gt;Journey Milestones&lt;&gt; section of the Catalogue &amp; Guide (&lt;IMG&gt;OPTIONS&lt;&gt;).&#xA;&#xA;The &lt;VAL_ON&gt;Mission Board&lt;&gt; is the most efficient way of raising standing. Missions reward standing with the system's dominant lifeforms or one of the three &lt;SPECIAL&gt;guilds&lt;&gt;: the &lt;VAL_ON&gt;Merchants Guild&lt;&gt;, the &lt;VAL_ON&gt;Explorers Guild&lt;&gt; and the &lt;VAL_ON&gt;Mercenaries Guild&lt;&gt;.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;VAL_ON&gt;Offering gifts&lt;&gt; to aliens on space stations or planetary outposts is a great way to increase your standing. Different lifeforms prefer different gifts. High standing with the universe's various lifeforms can unlock &lt;SPECIAL&gt;discounts&lt;&gt; on technology upgrades.&#xA;&#xA;Higher standing with the Guilds grants access to &lt;VAL_ON&gt;higher level missions with improved rewards&lt;&gt;. In addition, each space station hosts a &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Guild Envoy&lt;&gt; who offers &lt;STELLAR&gt;free supplies&lt;&gt; or heavily discounted items to members of the good standing. &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Donating&lt;&gt; supplies to these envoys will increase your standing with their guild.&#xA;&#xA;Hunting and destroying pirate &lt;VAL_ON&gt;bounties&lt;&gt; will increase your standing with the system's dominant lifeforms." />
