		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="UI_GUIDE_BODY_COMBAT_3">
			<Property name="Id" value="UI_GUIDE_BODY_COMBAT_3" />
			<Property name="English" value="Damage received while on-foot (from combat, hostile fauna or environmental damage) will first deplete your &lt;COMMODITY&gt;shield&lt;&gt;. &#xA;&#xA;Your shield will recharge over time. Take cover and avoid taking damage while the shield is low. Damage taken while shields are down will deplete your &lt;FUEL&gt;health&lt;&gt;.&#xA;&#xA;Purchase plans for a &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Personal Forcefield&lt;&gt; at &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;technology merchants&lt;&gt;. This is a powerful combat shield deployed from the Multi-Tool.&#xA;&#xA;Exosuit defensive and life support systems can be upgraded with &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;new technology&lt;&gt;. Visit &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;technology merchants&lt;&gt; on space stations to upgrade." />
