			<Property name="Id" value="UI_GUIDE_BODY_RECIPES" />
			<Property name="English" value="&lt;VAL_ON&gt;Upgrade Modules&lt;&gt; can be purchased ready crafted from technology merchants. These merchants are also a useful source of pre-built components. Seek them out in the Space Station Marketplace, or find them in smaller &lt;STELLAR&gt;planetary shops&lt;&gt;.&#xA;&#xA;To craft &lt;COMMODITY&gt;products&lt;&gt; and &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;technologies&lt;&gt; yourself, you must learn their blueprints.&#xA;&#xA;Learn the plans for specific technologies by visiting research stations aboard the &lt;SPECIAL&gt;Space Anomaly&lt;&gt;.&#xA;&#xA;Product recipes are more rare and must be sought out by raiding various &lt;STELLAR&gt;planetary installations&lt;&gt;. Find directions to such installations by exchanging navigation data with a space station &lt;TRADEABLE&gt;Cartographer&lt;&gt;." />
