		</Property>
		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="NPC_WATERPLAQUE_5">
			<Property name="Id" value="NPC_WATERPLAQUE_5" />
			<Property name="English" value="I've surveyed uncountable millions, but there's nothing. All the other rocks look so drab and dull, so lifeless, so damaged. No matter how deep I go, there's never anything to match it.&#xA;&#xA;I see whole worlds, stars, reflected in its brilliance. I know there must be more out there." />
