			<Property name="Id" value="NPC_WATERPLAQUE_7" />
			<Property name="English" value="I found it. It took me days, but I found it. The worst days since I left the surface. I missed it so much.&#xA;&#xA;The fault was all mine. When I found it, it was still as perfect as the day I found it. But my eyes... something is changing.&#xA;&#xA;I'm so glad it's back." />
