			<Property name="Id" value="NPC_WATERPLAQUE_8" />
			<Property name="English" value="I took my glove off this morning, to better grasp my pebble. The time down here has changed me. How long has it been? I've lost track...the green gave way to blue so long ago.&#xA;&#xA;My hands are clear, pure. The light shines through me. Like glass. I -" />
