			<Property name="English" value="The stranger carves a series of glyphs into the portal, then steps across the threshold.&#xA;The recording warps slightly, but continues. I see the stranger standing on a hexagonal world, dwarfed by the wreck of a large starship. Their starship? They help a figure to their feet, a Korvax. With a jolt, I recognise Nada.&#xA;The Priest Entity seems to stare right at me, aware that I have seen this reunion. They nod, and the recording ends." />
