			<Property name="Id" value="NPC_COMM_WEEK_06_STORY_END_7" />
			<Property name="English" value="I see the stranger turn away from the portal, a sad shake of their head. But there seems to have been a mutiny. Their surviving crewmates ignore their pleas and enter the portal, unheeding. They are consumed by the foam, and the portal closes with a crimson flash.&#xA;The stranger walks a short distance, shaken. They assemble a small shelter, enter and close the door. The recording does not show them emerge." />
