			<Property name="Id" value="NPC_COMM_WEEK_06_STORY_END_9" />
			<Property name="English" value="I see the stranger tap the control panel of the portal, their hands guided by an unseen force. The gateway opens, its blue light spilling out onto the surrounding landscape.&#xA;In this light, the stranger addresses their remaining crew. They try to persuade them to follow into the portal, but with no success. One by one, the crew walk away. Only the stranger remains.&#xA;Finally, they begin their approach. The foam consumes them, then dies down. The portal quietly closes. The recording shows nothing more." />
