		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="UI_U4_TRAVELLER_LOG_6">
			<Property name="Id" value="UI_U4_TRAVELLER_LOG_6" />
			<Property name="English" value="The First Spawn fought valiantly, but there was no saving them. The nanites had found their place within, protruding outward through every pore, through every limb and every thought.&#xA;&#xA;And it was done. They departed with the family of glass, forever lost to this world, their story at an end.&#xA;&#xA;I ventured on. We were almost there." />
