			<Property name="Id" value="UI_U4_TRAVELLER_LOG_7" />
			<Property name="English" value="Something was very wrong. The ATLAS interface had grown still, its orb cold and almost grey. The computers did not respond. Nothing did.&#xA;&#xA;It took a few moments before I realised that Laylaps was gone.&#xA;&#xA;I was alone." />
