			<Property name="Id" value="UI_U4_TRAVELLER_LOG_8" />
			<Property name="English" value="I heard the music again this morning – that same signal that led me to this realm. I stood and listened, honing my instruments to find the source, expecting some different result, but what use was science here?&#xA;&#xA;If a computer is on fire, what good are the prayers of data?" />
