		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="UI_U4_TRAVELLER_LOG_9">
			<Property name="Id" value="UI_U4_TRAVELLER_LOG_9" />
			<Property name="English" value="They had captured my friend. I saw them from a distance, the family of glass in all their majesty, cradling the fallen Sentinel, its light flickering in their awful embrace.&#xA;&#xA;I let out an involuntary cry as they cut into its exoskeleton, and each vacant stare, each grin of malice turned to me.&#xA;&#xA;I fled, but it was no use. They numbered in the hundreds. They found me." />
